      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "Search field from the provider directory, with its real placeholder and accessible name.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search providers\" placeholder=\"Search providers…\"/></div>",
      "css": ".ds-search{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#e3e8e0);border-radius:7px;height:41px;padding:0 12px;max-width:385px;width:100%;color:var(--subtle,#667369);}.ds-search:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#245c45);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-search input{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;border:0;background:none;outline:none;color:var(--foreground,#1c2923);width:100%;min-width:0;font-size:11px;caret-color:var(--brand,#245c45);}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#627068);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Provider research field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "research-input",
      "description": "Visible label, provider input, and help from the live research form.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-provider\">Which provider are you integrating?</label><div class=\"ds-research-input\"><input id=\"ds-provider\" name=\"provider\" placeholder=\"A provider name or website, e.g. notion.so\" maxlength=\"160\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"ds-provider-help\"/></div><p class=\"ds-field-help\" id=\"ds-provider-help\">Use a public provider name or URL. Never enter API keys, client secrets, or private account information.</p>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:var(--foreground,#1c2923);margin-bottom:9px;}.ds-research-input{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--border,#e3e8e0);border-radius:7px;padding:0 13px;background:var(--canvas,#fafbf8);color:var(--muted,#627068);}.ds-research-input input{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;background:none;border:0;outline:none;color:var(--foreground,#1c2923);width:100%;min-width:0;height:44px;font-size:12px;caret-color:var(--brand,#245c45);}.ds-research-input:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--brand,#245c45);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-field-help{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted,#627068);margin:10px 0 0;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item",
      "description": "Icon-and-text navigation with a semantic current-page state.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 6 4 14M12 6v14M8 8v12M4 4v16\"/></svg>Provider library</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:42px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#627068);text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,color .15s;}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--surface-soft,#f3f5f0);color:var(--foreground,#1c2923);}.ds-nav[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--accent,#edf3e9);color:var(--brand,#245c45);font-weight:600;}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#245c45);outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Category filter",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "The selected provider-category filter is exposed through aria-pressed.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All providers</button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;border:1px solid transparent;background:none;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--muted,#627068);cursor:pointer;}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--border,#e3e8e0);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#1c2923);font-weight:550;}.ds-filter:hover{background:var(--surface-soft,#f3f5f0);}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#245c45);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source-confirmed evidence",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "evidence-confirmed",
      "description": "A noninteractive status label; the real source link remains a separate adjacent control.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-evidence\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg>Source confirmed</span>",
      "css": ".ds-evidence{font-family:\"DM Sans Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 6px;background:var(--accent,#edf3e9);color:var(--brand,#245c45);width:max-content;line-height:1.7;}"
    },
    {
